    (descr "TI TPS259470ARPWR RPW0010A 2x2mm HotRod10. Manufacturer land/stencil 4225183/A 08/2019, TPS25947 RevC pp72-74. Pins5/6 are full-length IN/OUT bars; no EP/pad11. L-shaped corner pads, R0.05 convex corners, sharp inner notch. Separate paste follows TI0.100mm stencil example: corner93%, IN/OUT82%. NSMD0.05mm margin. Assembly qualification required.")
